===persian===

تو به سفری کوتاه می‌روی
من از کوچه بی تو...
من از خانه بی تو... می‌گذرم...
من بی تو می‌گذرم...
برف می‌بارد...
برف بی تو می‌بارد...
برف بر گونه‌هایم در اشک می‌بارد...
من در برف بی تو می‌گذرم...
کوچه خاموش است...
خانه خاموش است...
من بی حرف در برف می‌گذرم...

زمستان ۱۳۶۷

===machine===

You go on a short journey
I pass through the alley without you...
I pass through the house without you...
I pass without you...
It is snowing...
It snows without you...
Snow falls on my cheeks in tears...
I pass in the snow without you...
The alley is silent...
The house is silent...
I pass wordlessly in the snow...

Winter 1367

===lantern===

You leave on a short journey.
I — without you — through the alley...
without you — through the house... I pass...
Without you, I pass...
Snow is falling...
the snow falls without you...
snow falls on my cheeks, falls into tears...
Without you, I pass through the snow...
The alley is silent...
the house is silent...
wordless, I pass through the snow...

Winter 1367

===translation===

You go away on a short journey.
I pass through the alley without you...
through the house without you...
I pass, without you...
Snow is falling...
the snow falls without you...
snow falls on my cheeks and dissolves into tears...
I pass through the snow without you...
The alley has gone quiet...
the house has gone quiet...
and wordless, I pass through the snow...

— Winter 1367

===footnotes===

The poem runs on a single repeated verb, می‌گذرم ("I pass / I pass through"), and the refrain بی تو ("without you"). "برف بر گونه‌هایم در اشک می‌بارد" is literally "snow falls on my cheeks into tears" — the snow melting on a warm face becomes weeping; I rendered it "snow falls on my cheeks and dissolves into tears." خاموش is both "silent" and "extinguished," so the hushed alley and house are also, faintly, snuffed out.
